  "title": "Regular Verbs (-ar)",
  "prerequisiteIds": ["es-lesson-tener"],
  "blocks": [
    { "type": "explanation", "markdown": "Most Spanish verbs ending in **-ar** (like *trabajar*, *estudiar*, *hablar*) follow a regular pattern in the present tense:\n\nyo **-o** · tú **-as** · él/ella/usted **-a** · nosotros **-amos** · vosotros **-áis** · ellos/ustedes **-an**\n\ne.g. *hablar* → habl**o**, habl**as**, habl**a**, habl**amos**, habl**áis**, habl**an**." },
    { "type": "exercise", "exerciseId": "es-ex-ar-1" },
    { "type": "exercise", "exerciseId": "es-ex-ar-2" },
    { "type": "exercise", "exerciseId": "es-ex-ar-3" },
    { "type": "exercise", "exerciseId": "es-ex-ar-4" }
  ],
  "exercises": [
